{"3648640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ashen Daughter", "steam_appid": 3648640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A grieving girl. A broken world. A path soaked in blood and memory.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashen Daughter is set in a crumbling world where the old gods have fallen silent. Play as Kára, a young woman resurrected by the Whisperer. Driven by vengeance but shadowed by grief, she must face corrupted emissaries, buried memories, and the sins of her own family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruined villages, enchanted forests, and lightless caverns. Unlock powerful abilities, uncover the fate of your people, and decide whether forgiveness is possible in a world built on sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned Metroidvania player or simply drawn to a beautifully told story you can explore at your own pace, Ashen Daughter offers a deeply emotional journey with fluid controls, meaningful choices, and a world worth getting lost in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra responsive and satisfying movement &amp; combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D world inspired by Norse folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full 4K support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Bargains: Sacrifice your health for powerful, lasting upgrades to fuel your fury</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional story of vengeance, grief, and forgiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native Windows, Linux, and Mac support</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join our Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’d love to hear your thoughts and feedback. Join our Discord server &quot;Ashen Daughter&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also reach us at:  <a href=\"mailto:contact@bluebichon.com\">contact@bluebichon.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648640/extras/87429fb6f1a1fccdd826b83f853946b6.poster.avif?t=1773120711\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648640/extras/87429fb6f1a1fccdd826b83f853946b6.webm?t=1773120711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648640/extras/87429fb6f1a1fccdd826b83f853946b6.mp4?t=1773120711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A grieving girl. A broken world. A path soaked in blood and memory.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashen Daughter is set in a crumbling world where the old gods have fallen silent. Play as Kára, a young woman resurrected by the Whisperer. Driven by vengeance but shadowed by grief, she must face corrupted emissaries, buried memories, and the sins of her own family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruined villages, enchanted forests, and lightless caverns. Unlock powerful abilities, uncover the fate of your people, and decide whether forgiveness is possible in a world built on sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned Metroidvania player or simply drawn to a beautifully told story you can explore at your own pace, Ashen Daughter offers a deeply emotional journey with fluid controls, meaningful choices, and a world worth getting lost in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra responsive and satisfying movement &amp; combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D world inspired by Norse folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full 4K support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Bargains: Sacrifice your health for powerful, lasting upgrades to fuel your fury</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional story of vengeance, grief, and forgiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native Windows, Linux, and Mac support</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join our Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’d love to hear your thoughts and feedback. Join our Discord server &quot;Ashen Daughter&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also reach us at:  <a href=\"mailto:contact@bluebichon.com\">contact@bluebichon.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648640/extras/87429fb6f1a1fccdd826b83f853946b6.poster.avif?t=1773120711\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648640/extras/87429fb6f1a1fccdd826b83f853946b6.webm?t=1773120711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648640/extras/87429fb6f1a1fccdd826b83f853946b6.mp4?t=1773120711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Battle corrupted emissaries, explore a mythical world, and sacrifice health for power in this hand-drawn Metroidvania. With tight, responsive controls, guide Kára on a journey of grief, vengeance, and forgiveness.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648640/9393c916186db87d82bce67f88a83f12f2e4ffd0/header.jpg?t=1773120711", "capsule